    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_02_dragon_13",
      "hash64": "292A7D35F9FE1CE6",
      "text": "Así pues, cuando vuestro rival se teracristalice en\\npleno combate...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_f_02_dragon_14",
      "hash64": "292A8035F9FE21FF",
      "text": "Os bastará con fijaros en la joya Teracristal para\\nsaber qué tipo ha adoptado.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_f_02_dragon_15",
      "hash64": "292A7F35F9FE204C",
      "text": "Así podréis abatirlo con los movimientos\\nadecuados...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
